{#
  The plain answer to "Is Ferni a person?" (owner decision 2026-10-18: say it
  here on the website, not inside the app). Linked from every footer, the
  homepage, both FAQs and the sign-up modal. Ferni speaks as himself, so the
  copy is in the first person; it names the technology in prose and never as
  a label. e2e/website-what-ferni-is.spec.ts keeps it from quietly going away.
#}
<main class="story-page what-ferni-is" id="main-content">

  <section class="story-page__hero what-ferni-is__hero">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <p class="story-page__eyebrow">What Ferni is</p>
      <h1 class="story-page__headline">I'm not a person.</h1>
      <p class="story-page__text">
        I'm software, built with artificial intelligence. I listen, I remember what matters to you, and I talk with you.
        Real people built me, and they stand behind me.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story-page__section what-ferni-is__section">
    <div class="story-page__block">
      <h2 class="story-page__subhead">How I work</h2>
      <p class="story-page__text">
        When we talk, large language models help me understand what you say and find the words to answer.
        The voice you hear is made by software too. Maya, Peter, Alex, Jordan and Nayan work the same way:
        each has a personality and a focus, and none of them is a person either.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story-page__section what-ferni-is__section">
    <div class="story-page__block">
      <h2 class="story-page__subhead">Who's behind me</h2>
      <p class="story-page__text">
        Real people build Ferni and look after it. If something I said felt off,
        or you'd just like to talk to a person, <a href="/contact/">write to them</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story-page__section what-ferni-is__section" id="care">
    <div class="story-page__block">
      <h2 class="story-page__subhead">What I'm not</h2>
      <p class="story-page__text">
        I'm not a therapist, a doctor or emergency help, and I don't take their place.
        If you're in crisis or need someone right now, call or text <a href="tel:988">988</a> in the US
        (the <a href="https://988lifeline.org/" rel="noopener">988 Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline</a>),
        or your local emergency number.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story-page__section what-ferni-is__section">
    <div class="story-page__block">
      <h2 class="story-page__subhead">Yours to keep, or delete</h2>
      <p class="story-page__text">
        What you share is yours. You can delete your account and everything in it, any time.
      </p>
      <p class="story-page__text what-ferni-is__links">
        <a href="/delete-account/">Delete your account</a>
        <a href="/privacy/">Read the privacy policy</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

